## Translate SWRL built-ins during inference

Context: The active "Owns meter" rule returned no inferred relationships even
when customers had active contracts linked to meters. The inference translator
treated `swrlb:contains` as a graph property instead of applying its SQL string
predicate.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/reasoning/SWRLSQLTranslator.py
   Exclude built-ins from inference graph joins and apply them as SQL filters after antecedent variables are bound.
2. tests/units/ontology/test_swrl_engine.py
   Add a regression test requiring `swrlb:contains` to produce a SQL filter rather than a nonexistent property join.

Modified files:
- src/back/core/reasoning/SWRLSQLTranslator.py
- tests/units/ontology/test_swrl_engine.py
- changelogs/v0.8.1/benoitcayladbx_2026-09-24.log

